---

## 🗄 Database Design

### Customers Table

| Field | Type |
|---------|---------|
| id | UUID / INT |
| name | VARCHAR |
| email | VARCHAR |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP |

### Products Table

| Field | Type |
|---------|---------|
| id | UUID / INT |
| name | VARCHAR |
| description | TEXT |
| price | DECIMAL |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP |

### Reviews Table

| Field | Type |
|---------|---------|
| id | UUID / INT |
| customer_id | FK |
| product_id | FK |
| rating | INT |
| comment | TEXT |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP |

### Relationships

```text
Customer (1) ---- (*) Review (*) ---- (1) Product
```

Rules:

- One customer can create multiple reviews.
- One product can receive multiple reviews.
- One customer can review a product only once.

---

## 🌐 API Endpoints

### Customers

#### Create Customer

```http
POST /api/customers
```

#### Get All Customers

```http
GET /api/customers
```

---

### Products

#### Create Product

```http
POST /api/products
```

Example:

```json
{
  "name": "iPhone 15",
  "description": "Apple smartphone",
  "price": 999.99
}
```

#### Get All Products

```http
GET /api/products
```

#### Get Product By ID

```http
GET /api/products/:id
```

---

### Reviews

#### Create Review

```http
POST /api/reviews
```

Example:

```json
{
  "customerId": 1,
  "productId": 10,
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excellent product!"
}
```

#### Get Product Reviews

```http
GET /api/products/:id/reviews
```

---

## ✅ Input Validation

### Customer Validation

- Name is required.
- Email format must be valid.

### Product Validation

- Product name is required.
- Price must be positive.

### Review Validation

- Rating is required.
- Rating must be between 1 and 5.
- Comment cannot be empty.
- Customer must exist.
- Product must exist.
- Duplicate reviews must be rejected.

---

## ⚠️ Error Handling

The API returns meaningful JSON error responses.

Example:

```json
{
  "statusCode": 400,
  "message": "Product already reviewed by this customer",
  "error": "Bad Request"
}
```

Common Errors:

| Status Code | Description |
|------------|-------------|
| 400 | Validation error |
| 404 | Resource not found |
| 409 | Duplicate review |
| 500 | Internal server error |

